  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n> Assert: options's href is not the empty string.\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-link-request\n\nI think this assertion can be hit from\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fetching-and-processing-a-resource-from-a-link-element:create-a-link-request\n\nand\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-preload:create-a-link-request",
